{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a fully serverless REST API using Function Compute behind an API Gateway, with Tair for caching and Tablestore for storage."}
{"t":"plan","products":["mobile-app","dns","esa","cloud-native-api-gateway","fc","tair","tablestore","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"mobile-app","label":"Mobile app","group":"internet","why":"End users calling the REST API."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves API domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-dns","from":"app","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"DDoS defense, WAF and global acceleration for API traffic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-esa","from":"app","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"API VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"gw","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes REST calls, handles auth and throttling."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-gw","from":"esa","to":"gw","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"fc","label":"API functions","group":"vpc","why":"Serverless compute that scales to zero; pay per request."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gw-api","from":"gw","to":"api","label":"invoke"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Hot data cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches frequent reads to cut latency and FC invocations."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-cache","from":"api","to":"cache","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"tablestore","label":"Data store","group":"sg","why":"Serverless NoSQL table; auto-scales with spiky writes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-db","from":"api","to":"db","label":"query"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects gateway and function logs for debugging."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless REST API: mobile app through ESA to Cloud-native API Gateway, Function Compute, Tair cache and Tablestore."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw an ACK-based microservices platform with MSE for discovery, Cloud-native API Gateway, RocketMQ, Tair and PolarDB."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","ack","mse","rocketmq","tair","polardb","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Clients","group":"internet","why":"Callers reaching the microservices platform."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to the ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Microservices VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Ingress load balancer for the API gateway."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Single entry point routing to 20 services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway","label":"route"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK Cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the 20 Java microservices on Kubernetes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-ack","from":"gateway","to":"ack","label":"gRPC/HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"mse","product":"mse","label":"MSE Nacos","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Service discovery and config for all microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mse","from":"ack","to":"mse","label":"discovery","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"mq","product":"rocketmq","label":"RocketMQ","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Async messaging between the 20 services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mq","from":"ack","to":"mq","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Shared cache for hot data across services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"polardb","label":"PolarDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational database for persistent service data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs and tracing for all services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"ACK cluster with MSE Nacos, Cloud-native API Gateway, RocketMQ, Tair and PolarDB for 20 Java microservices."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a highly available two-zone web store in Singapore, fronted by ESA and ALB with WAF, ECS behind Auto Scaling for sales peaks, Tair cache and RDS."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers","group":"internet","why":"30,000 daily users browsing the online store."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the store domain to ESA edge nodes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets and accelerates dynamic pages across Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Store VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes traffic across two zones for high availability."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks and bots before reaching the app."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Web servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the store application across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Adds instances automatically during big sales peaks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Sessions go to Tair and orders to RDS, both deployed across two zones for resilience."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Keeps carts and sessions fast with zone-level HA."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores orders with a standby replica in the second zone."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product images that ESA serves from the edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes logs and alerts for monitoring store health."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Highly available two-zone web store in Singapore with ESA, ALB+WAF, ECS with Auto Scaling, Tair cache and RDS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a RAG assistant architecture where employees query an AgentCore agent that retrieves answers from your policy docs via Model Studio."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","agentcore","model-studio","milvus","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"external","kind":"external","label":"Employees","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"external","why":"Staff asking policy and wiki questions."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"agentcore","product":"agentcore","label":"Internal Assistant Agent","group":"sg","why":"Orchestrates retrieval and Qwen responses for employees."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-agentcore","from":"users","to":"agentcore","label":"questions"}
{"t":"node","id":"model-studio","product":"model-studio","label":"Qwen Models","group":"sg","why":"Generates grounded answers from retrieved policy text."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-model","from":"agentcore","to":"model-studio","label":"LLM calls"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector-db","product":"milvus","label":"Policy Vector Store","group":"sg","why":"Holds embeddings of policy docs and wiki pages for RAG."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-vector","from":"agentcore","to":"vector-db","label":"retrieval"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Source Documents","group":"sg","why":"Stores raw policy PDFs and wiki exports for ingestion."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-docs-vector","from":"docs","to":"vector-db","label":"ingestion","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Agent Logs","group":"sg","why":"Traces queries and retrieval for auditing and improvement."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-logs","from":"agentcore","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"rec","product":"qwenwork","fit":"complement","why":"Ready-made workplace agent if you prefer not to build custom RAG pipelines."}
{"t":"done","summary":"RAG assistant using AgentCore, Qwen via Model Studio, Milvus vector store and OSS document source."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a data platform in Singapore: RDS MySQL replicated via DTS to MaxCompute for batch, with Hologres serving Quick BI dashboards."}
{"t":"plan","products":["rds","dts","maxcompute","dataworks","hologres","quick-bi","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Data Platform VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"orders-db","product":"rds","label":"Orders MySQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Source order database with HA standby."}
{"t":"node","id":"dts-sync","product":"dts","label":"DTS Real-time Sync","group":"vpc","why":"Streams CDC changes from MySQL to warehouse."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-orders-dts","from":"orders-db","to":"dts-sync","label":"CDC","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"warehouse","product":"maxcompute","label":"MaxCompute Warehouse","group":"vpc","why":"Stores replicated data and runs nightly batch jobs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-warehouse","from":"dts-sync","to":"warehouse","label":"sync","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"scheduler","product":"dataworks","label":"DataWorks Scheduler","group":"vpc","why":"Orchestrates nightly ETL pipelines over MaxCompute."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-scheduler-warehouse","from":"scheduler","to":"warehouse","label":"ETL","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"serving","product":"hologres","label":"Hologres Serving","group":"vpc","why":"Fast interactive query engine for dashboard serving."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-warehouse-serving","from":"warehouse","to":"serving","label":"batch load","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"dashboards","product":"quick-bi","label":"Quick BI Dashboards","group":"vpc","why":"Business dashboards querying Hologres directly."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-serving-dashboards","from":"serving","to":"dashboards","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Pipeline Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes ETL and sync logs for monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-scheduler-logs","from":"scheduler","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"RDS MySQL replicated by DTS to MaxCompute, scheduled by DataWorks, served through Hologres to Quick BI dashboards."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a real-time IoT telemetry pipeline: devices send data through IoT Platform, Flink detects anomalies, and DataV powers the dashboard."}
{"t":"plan","products":["iot-devices","iot-platform","kafka","flink","tair","lindorm","datav","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"field","kind":"external","label":"Field","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"devices","product":"iot-devices","label":"100k IoT devices","group":"field","why":"Sends telemetry every few seconds to the cloud."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"IoT VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"iot","product":"iot-platform","label":"IoT Platform","group":"sg","why":"Ingests and routes telemetry from 100k devices via MQTT."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-devices-iot","from":"devices","to":"iot","label":"MQTT","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"kafka","product":"kafka","label":"Kafka","group":"vpc","why":"Buffers high-throughput telemetry for stream processing."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-iot-kafka","from":"iot","to":"kafka","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"flink","product":"flink","label":"Flink","group":"vpc","why":"Real-time stream processing and anomaly detection on telemetry."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-kafka-flink","from":"kafka","to":"flink","label":"stream","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Holds latest device states for the live dashboard."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-cache","from":"flink","to":"cache","label":"state","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"tsdb","product":"lindorm","label":"Lindorm","group":"vpc","why":"Stores time-series telemetry at scale for historical analysis."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-tsdb","from":"flink","to":"tsdb","label":"write","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"dashboard","product":"datav","label":"DataV Dashboard","group":"sg","why":"Live large-screen dashboard visualizing device telemetry and alerts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dashboard-cache","from":"dashboard","to":"cache","label":"read","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dashboard-tsdb","from":"dashboard","to":"tsdb","label":"query","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Collects pipeline logs and triggers anomaly alert notifications."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-logs","from":"flink","to":"logs","label":"alerts","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Real-time IoT pipeline: 100k devices via IoT Platform, Kafka buffering, Flink anomaly detection, Tair state cache, Lindorm time-series storage, DataV dashboard and SLS alerts."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll connect your Singapore data center via Express Connect and set up a migration VPC with SMC and DTS for step-by-step VM migration."}
{"t":"req","text":"On-premises data center in Singapore","regions":["ap-southeast-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","cen","transit-router","vpc","ecs","smc","dts","cloud-backup","sls","cloudmonitor"]}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"On-premises DC (Singapore)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"On-premises data center","group":"onprem","why":"Existing workloads to migrate gradually."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"ec","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect","group":"sg","why":"Private dedicated link from on-prem to cloud."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-ec","from":"dc","to":"ec","label":"private link"}
{"t":"node","id":"cen","product":"cen","label":"CEN","group":null,"why":"Global network hub connecting hybrid links."}
{"t":"node","id":"tr","product":"transit-router","label":"Transit Router","group":"sg","why":"Regional router attaching VPC and Express Connect."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-tr","from":"ec","to":"tr","label":"VBR"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-tr-cen","from":"tr","to":"cen","kind":"control"}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Migration VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-tr-vpc","from":"tr","to":"vpc","label":"attach"}
{"t":"say","text":"Now adding target ECS instances and the migration tools inside the VPC."}
{"t":"node","id":"target-vms","product":"ecs","label":"Target ECS instances","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Cloud VMs receiving migrated workloads."}
{"t":"node","id":"smc","product":"smc","label":"Server Migration Center","group":"sg","why":"Step-by-step VM migration from on-prem to ECS."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-smc-target","from":"smc","to":"target-vms","kind":"control","label":"migrate"}
{"t":"node","id":"dts","product":"dts","label":"DTS","group":"sg","why":"Syncs databases during phased cutover."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-target","from":"dts","to":"target-vms","kind":"data","label":"db sync"}
{"t":"node","id":"backup","product":"cloud-backup","label":"Cloud Backup","group":"sg","why":"Protects migrated VMs and enables rollback."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-target-backup","from":"target-vms","to":"backup","kind":"control","label":"backup"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs for migration monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-target-logs","from":"target-vms","to":"logs","kind":"control","label":"logs"}
{"t":"node","id":"monitor","product":"cloudmonitor","label":"CloudMonitor","group":"sg","why":"Alerts on migration health and resource usage."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-monitor-target","from":"monitor","to":"target-vms","kind":"control","label":"metrics"}
{"t":"done","summary":"On-prem Singapore DC connected via Express Connect to a CEN Transit Router, with SMC and DTS migrating VMs step by step into a two-zone VPC."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a live-streaming and VOD platform for e-sports using ApsaraVideo Live, VOD, ESA for delivery, and OSS for storage."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","live","vod","mps","oss","sls","rds","tair"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"E-sports fans","group":"internet","why":"Viewers watching live streams and VOD content."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves platform domain to ESA edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates live stream playback and caches VOD assets globally."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Platform VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes API and web traffic to backend services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs platform business logic and APIs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches user sessions and stream metadata."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Platform DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores user data, channels and VOD catalog."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"say","text":"Now adding the media pipeline: Live ingest, VOD, transcoding and object storage."}
{"t":"node","id":"live","product":"live","label":"ApsaraVideo Live","group":"sg","why":"Ingests, transcodes and distributes e-sports live streams."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-live","from":"esa","to":"live","label":"pull"}
{"t":"node","id":"vod","product":"vod","label":"ApsaraVideo VOD","group":"sg","why":"Manages VOD uploads, transcoding and encrypted playback."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-vod","from":"esa","to":"vod","label":"pull"}
{"t":"node","id":"mps","product":"mps","label":"Media Processing","group":"sg","why":"Transcodes and processes recorded streams into VOD assets."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-live-mps","from":"live","to":"mps","label":"record"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-mps-vod","from":"mps","to":"vod","label":"output"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Media storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores raw recordings, transcoded videos and thumbnails."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-live-media","from":"live","to":"media","label":"record"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-vod-media","from":"vod","to":"media","label":"assets"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes access logs and stream analytics."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"E-sports streaming platform with ESA edge delivery, ApsaraVideo Live and VOD, MPS transcoding, OSS storage, ECS backend, Tair cache and RDS."}

